Market position

- The US credit rating market is almost monopolistic (historical > 90% of the market)
- FICO Scorre embedded in almost all mortgage, credit card, car loan approval processes in the United States
- Previously Fannie Mae and Freddy Mac accepted only FIO ratings (VantageScore from 2026)
- FICO Platform is a leading global fraud detection field.

